        "text_39CANr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Authenticity</strong></p><p>Every designer piece we sell is 100% authentic. We do not sell fakes or replicas.</p><p>Most of our luxury pieces come from a close, trusted network of sellers. Every item is checked by our team in London before it’s listed, and not everything we’re offered makes the cut.</p><p><strong>What we check</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Labels:</strong> brand, size and care labels, matched against the brand’s genuine details</li><li><strong>Serial numbers:</strong> checked where the brand uses them</li><li><strong>Hardware:</strong> zips, buttons, clasps and fastenings, including engravings and weight</li><li><strong>Stitching and seams:</strong> secure, even and finished to the brand’s standard</li><li><strong>Materials and finishing:</strong> fabric, leather, linings and hems</li><li><strong>Condition:</strong> any wear, marks, pilling or fading is noted in the listing</li></ul><p>See exactly how we do it in our blog post, <a href=\"https://www.mycircularwardrobe.com/blogs/news/before-it-reaches-you-how-we-inspect-every-preloved-piece\">Before It Reaches You: How We Inspect Every Preloved Piece</a>.</p><p><strong>If you have any doubts</strong><br/><br/>Email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@mycircularwardrobe.com\">info@mycircularwardrobe.com</a> and we’ll send extra photos of the labels, serial numbers or any detail you’d like to see. If an item is ever found not to be authentic, we’ll give you a full refund, including postage.</p><p>We aim to describe every item accurately. If anything doesn’t match its listing, we’ll refund you in full, including the cost of postage.</p>"
          }
        }
